<title>PHILIPPINES: Davao Union to issue one bln preferred shrs.</title>
<headline>Davao Union to issue one bln preferred shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davao Union Cement Corp said on Tuesday it would issue one billion preferred shares to cover the increase in its authorised capital to three billion pesos from the present two billion.</p>
<p>The company told the Philippine Stock Exchange the shares are non-voting and redeemable within five years from issue date.</p>
<p>Details of the offering have yet to be firmed up. The plan will be put to a special shareholder meeting on June 10.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
